message: "Please cite the paper (preferred-citation); if you use the hesi code, also cite the software."
title: "lockdowns-as-partial-holidays: Holiday-Equivalent Stoppage (HES) forecasting of Thailand's monthly exports through COVID-19"
abstract: >-
  Research code for the Holiday-Equivalent Stoppage (HES) framework, which
  treats a lockdown as a partial holiday: a work-stoppage elasticity
  identified from recurring holidays (Thai public holidays including
  Songkran, and the Chinese New Year window) through one shared Prophet
  regressor per channel is transferred to the pandemic with a dose, the
  Holiday-Equivalent Stoppage Index computed from Google Community Mobility.
  Includes the Monte Carlo study, robustness experiments, theory checks,
  the paper build and a runner for official export data.
type: software
authors:
